<section id="1002J_S000U" variety="S000U">
<name>Brake Control</name>
<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060T00SX" category="J" type-id="300FD" name-id="442OX-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Slip Indicator Light System</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060T00SX_06" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TN00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The slip indicator light blinks when slip control is operating to inform the driver of the occurrence of slip and system operation.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The slip indicator light comes on together with the respective warning lights while TRC and VSC control are prohibited due to an ABS or VSC system malfunction. Also, the slip indicator light blinks when hill-start assist control is operating, and comes on during maintenance mode.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060T00SX_07" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TO00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C154594J01" width="7.106578999in" height="6.791605969in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060T00SX_08" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060T00SX_09" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000060T00SX_09_0021" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TP00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Control System CAN Communication System</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), inspect the DTCs and check that there is no malfunction in the CAN communication system. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Normal DTC</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060T00SX_09_0022" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060T00SX_09_0024" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060T00SX_09_0022" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TQ00000">
<scantool type="8"/>
<testtitle>Perform Active Test (SLIP Light)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), perform the Active Test of the slip indicator light. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Light comes on and goes off according to operation</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060T00SX_09_0023" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060T00SX_09_0025" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060T00SX_09_0023">
<testtitle>Replace ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000304V000X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060T00SX_09_0024">
<testtitle>Go to Control System CAN Communication System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060T00SX_09_0025">
<testtitle>Go to Meter &amp; Gauge System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001L5T00JX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
